- A) Draft the 1-page slide + 3-scenario model (I’ll need the P&L info above), or
- B) Draft the internal memo/slide narrative now using the illustrative numbers above, or
- C) Do a quick sensitivity table here with more % scenarios (e.g., burn cuts 0–25% and margin lifts 0–7ppt)?

