- 15% burn cut = $29.25K
- Net burn = 195K − 20K − 29.25K = 145.75K
- Runway ≈ 1.2M / 145.75K ≈ 8.2 months

Key takeaway: modest margin and cost actions (5ppt margin improvement + ~15–20% OPEX cut) extend runway materially (from ~6 to ~8–9.5 months). Combined with even modest revenue growth the effect compounds.

