   - Offer limited-time price increases or add-on fees for premium services.
   - Convert large customers to annual prepay contracts (improves cash immediately).
   - Target upsell campaigns to highest LTV customers.

Priority actions — tactical (30–90 days)
1. Margin improvements
   - Productize services to increase gross margin (standard deliverables, fixed-price).
   - Reduce COGS: improve supplier sourcing, automate manual processes, renegotiate SLAs.
   - Improve pricing segmentation (charge more for faster delivery, support tiers).
2. Sales & GTM efficiency
   - Improve conversion efficiency (lead quality, sales enablement).
   - Shorten CAC payback via tighter onboarding and immediate value delivery.
   - Expand higher-margin channels/partnerships.
